---
title: "trackApplicationStatus (Legion: API Integration Flow)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: GET /v1/integration/rounds/id/application
    q_receive --> q_auth: validate JWT token
    q_auth --> q_unauthorized: token invalid
    q_unauthorized --> [*]: return 401 unauthorized
    q_auth --> q_lookup: token valid
    q_lookup --> q_not_found: round or application not found
    q_not_found --> [*]: return 404 not found
    q_lookup --> q_fetch: application exists
    q_fetch --> q_return: retrieve current status
    q_return --> [*]: return application status object

    note right of q_fetch
        INV-001: status reflects current review state (pending, approved, partial, rejected)
        INV-002: only the application owner may view their status
    end note
